      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَارَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتُورُ</span>, (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تير</span>,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْرٌ</span>,
(K,) <i>It</i> (water, TA) <i>ran,</i> or <i>flowed:</i> (K, TA:)
but this verb is obsolete. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تير</span>.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِيرَ الرَّجُلُ</span> [app. for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُئِرَ</span>] <i>Blood-revenge was had
of the man.</i> (M. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَارَةٌ</span>.])

